      "## Carl Rogers and the counseling relationship",
      "Carl Rogers' *Counseling and Psychotherapy* was published in 1942. His nondirective and later person-centered approach challenged the assumption that the helper should function primarily as an expert who diagnoses the problem and prescribes the solution.",
