      "The name changes matter because they mirror the shift from a narrower guidance identity toward counseling as a broad profession.",
      "## Community mental health and expanded access",
      "The Community Mental Health Centers Act of 1963 supported a movement toward community-based services. Counseling roles expanded in community agencies, schools, colleges, rehabilitation programs, substance-use services, hospitals, and other settings.",
