      "## A role-selection framework",
      "When determining the appropriate counselor role, ask:",
      "1. What does the client need now?\n2. What is the purpose of the setting or program?\n3. What does law and regulation authorize?\n4. What does the counselor's credential and competence support?\n5. What service can the setting safely provide?\n6. Is consultation, collaboration, referral, or a higher level of care needed?",
      "## Related lessons",
