    "whyItMatters": "`Allowed by the license` and `competent to provide` are different questions. A broad scope of practice does not mean every licensee is competent in every population, technique, diagnosis, assessment, or specialty. This lesson introduces the distinction. PO-05 will examine competence, supervision, boundaries, and referral in greater ethical detail.",
